{title: Geet Gaata Hoon Mai}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Shankar Jaikishan}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Bm] [A],        Geet gata hun mai gungunata hun mai
[F#] [Bm],        Maine hasne ka vaada kiya tha kabhi
[A] [Em] [A] [Bm],        Isliye ab sada muskurata hoon main
[Bm] [Em] [Bm],        Yeh mohabbat ke pal kitne anmol hai
[Bm] [F#],        Kitne phoolon se nazuk mere bol hai
[F#] [Bm],        Sab ko phulon ki mala pehnata hun mai
[Em] [Bm],        Muskurata hoon main
[Bm] [Em] [Bm],        Roshni hogi itni kise thi khabar
[Bm] [F#],        Mere mann ka yeh darpan gaya hai nikhar
[F#] [Bm],        Sath hai ab yeh darpan dikhata hoon mai
[Em] [Bm],        Muskurata hoon main
